NoetherNormalization -- routines related to Noether normalization
*****************************************************************

Description
===========

NoetherNormalization is a package for computing ring homomorphisms which will
place ideals in Noether normal position. The algorithms used are based on
algorithms found in A. Logar's paper: A Computational Proof of the Noether
Normalization Lemma. In: Proceedings 6th AAEEC, Lecture Notes in Computer
Science 357, Springer, 1989, 259-273.

