If noetherNormalization is unable to place the ideal into the desired position
after a few tries, the following warning is given:
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : R = ZZ/2[a,b];                                                   |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : I = ideal(a^2*b+a*b^2+1);                                        |
|                                                                      |
|o9 : Ideal of R                                                       |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : (f,J,X) = noetherNormalization I                                |
|--warning: no good linear transformation found by noetherNormalization|
|                                                                      |
|                                  2       2                           |
|o10 = (map (R, R, {b, a}), ideal(a b + a*b  + 1), {b})                |
|                                                                      |
|o10 : Sequence                                                        |
